flowchart TD
    A[Input: UNSW_NB15 training CSV] -->|load_data + ffill/one-hot/scale\ndata_handler.py| B[(Train features + labels)]

    subgraph Trainer["Trainer / Agent — train.py, models.py"]
        B --> RF[RandomForest\nclassifier]
        B --> TF[TensorFlow\nclassifier]
        B --> MALtrain[Malicious-activity\ndetector NN]
    end

    RF --> EVAL{{"Evaluator? — MISSING\ntrain.py only prints\ntest-split accuracy,\nno gate before deploy"}}
    TF --> EVAL
    MALtrain --> EVAL
    EVAL -.TODO: block deploy on\nheld-out metric threshold.-> DEPLOY[Deploy models\nto live monitor]

    C[Input: UNSW_NB15 testing CSV] -->|simulate_data_stream\nbatch every 10s| D[/Streamed batch/]
    D -->|preprocess_data: reindex + scale| E[(Batch features)]

    subgraph Retriever["Detector stack (retriever-equivalent) — ids_system.py, train.py"]
        E --> ISO[IsolationForest\nanomaly detector]
        ISO -->|detect_anomalies| F{Anomaly?}
        F -->|no| E
        F -->|yes| G[describe_anomalies\nCRITICAL/OK table]
        G --> MAL[Malicious detector NN]
        MAL -->|detect_malicious_activities| H{Above threshold?}
    end

    H -->|yes| ALERT[log.warning:\nMalicious activity DETECTED]
    H -->|no| LOGONLY[log details only]

    ALERT --> TESTER{{"Human/Tester checkpoint — MISSING\nno analyst review, no auto-triage;\nalert goes straight to retrain"}}
    LOGONLY --> UPDATE

    TESTER -.TODO: analyst confirms\ntrue/false positive.-> UPDATE[update_model:\nretrain TF monitor on batch\ntrain.py]
    UPDATE --> E

    DEPLOY --> ISO
    DEPLOY --> MAL

    style EVAL fill:#7c2d12,color:#fff,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    style TESTER fill:#7c2d12,color:#fff,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    style ALERT fill:#b91c1c,color:#fff
    style F fill:#1f2937,color:#fff
    style H fill:#1f2937,color:#fff
